# Under ID matching, native pairs a literal '.' summary ID with VCF records whose ID is '.'.
# read_tabix cannot tell '.' from an empty field (which native skips), so the reference
# rejects a missing summary ID when the VCF also has records without IDs; against a VCF
# whose records all have IDs it matches native.
